  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>StringArrayPropertyEditor</code> with the given separator.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的带有给定分隔符的<code>StringArrayPropertyEditor</code>。",
      "count": 9
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>separator</code> - the separator to use for splitting a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>separator</code> - 用于拆分 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 的分隔符",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>emptyArrayAsNull</code> - <code>true</code> if an empty String array\nis to be transformed into <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>emptyArrayAsNull</code> - 如果要将空 String 数组转换为 <code>null</code>，则设置为 <code>true</code>",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "An empty text (without elements) will be turned into an empty array.",
      "translation": "空文本（不含元素）将转换为空数组。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>trimValues</code> - <code>true</code> if the values in the parsed arrays\nare to be trimmed of whitespace (default is <code>true</code>)",
      "translation": "<code>trimValues</code> - 如果解析后的数组中的值需要修剪空白，则为 <code>true</code>（默认值为 <code>true</code>）",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>charsToDelete</code> - a set of characters to delete, in addition to\ntrimming an input String. Useful for deleting unwanted line breaks:\nfor example, \"\\r\\n\\f\" will delete all new lines and line feeds in a String.",
      "translation": "`charsToDelete` - 要删除的字符集，除了修剪输入字符串外。可用于删除不需要的换行符：例如，\"\\r\\n\\f\"将删除字符串中的所有新行和换行符。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Strings must be in CSV format, with a customizable separator.\nBy default, values in the result are trimmed of whitespace.",
      "translation": "字符串必须采用 CSV 格式，并支持自定义分隔符。默认情况下，结果中的值会去除首尾空格。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Default separator for splitting a String: a comma (\",\").",
      "translation": "默认用于分割字符串的分隔符：逗号 (\",\" )。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Rod Johnson, Juergen Hoeller, Dave Syer",
      "translation": "Rod Johnson、Juergen Hoeller 和 Dave Syer",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
